---
source: term/tests/help_snapshots.rs
expression: "help_output(\"mesg\")"
---
Display (or do not display) messages from other users

Usage: mesg [OPTIONS] [ACTION]

Arguments:
  [ACTION]  y to allow messages, n to disallow

Options:
  -v, --verbose  Explain what is being done
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
